  "body": "The spec isn't clear on what to do when postMessage-ing a closing/closed worker. If postMessage's structured cloning fails, it'll throw, which makes it arguable that postMessage-ing a closing/closed worker should throw as well. It's also arguable, however, that in this case postMessage should silently fail to be consistent with MessagePort.postMessage because MessagePort.postMessage silently fails if the entangled MessagePort is null.",
